        "original_id": "1aaeeef4-2eea-571c-a701-18d6a589b35a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kathy Mattea, Don Williams, Clark's husband\n- Products: \"Come from the Heart\", \"Willow in the Wind\", \"Traces\", \"Old Friends\"\n- Topics: Don Williams discography\n\nFacts:\n- Don Williams is an American country music artist, and there is a detailed discography for Don Williams.\n- The song \"Come from the Heart\" was first recorded and released on Don Williams's 1987 album \"Traces\".\n- Clark's husband also released \"Come from the Heart\" in 1988 on his album \"Old Friends\".\n- \"Come from the Heart\" is most known through Kathy Mattea's 1989 single, which was released in conjunction with her album \"Willow in the Wind\".",
